('cdeb5c3a-a0cf-4361-9b15-d8c7aa803c5b', 'b1ead201-ffaa-4ba3-886a-033f3a9c1dbe', 'email@example.com', 'YuDetailz - Ceramic VIP Car Detailing San Diego', 'BOUNCED', '2026-03-21 18:12:06.102+00', '19d1198e80a9d0c2', '19d1198e28691727', NULL, '0', '864eb27b-f59a-434a-b9a5-3c35183d2f5d', 'moazzam.insta@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'http://yudetailz.com/', 'one page change and a detailer went from calls only to online bookings', 'Hi YuDetailz - Ceramic VIP Car Detailing San Diego,\n\nA shop I helped a while back was getting all their business through word of mouth. After we rebuilt their ceramic coating page, online bookings started coming in regularly.\n\nThe difference was mostly layout. Reviews up top, clear service breakdown, one button.\n\nI put a sample together. Want to see it?\n\nBest,\nDemGrow', NULL, '{}', '2026-03-21 13:52:29.818716+00', NULL),
